BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (Detail: Settle only after receivable and payable balances reach zero and unresolved operational claims remain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (separately visible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (Production work starts before the first API event. The intake owner captures the shipper's legal entity, payment contact,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (purchase-order format, commodity, declared value, origin, destination, appointment windows, and special handling.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (The procurement owner confirms whether the proposed carrier's insurance actually addresses the commodity,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (deductible, exclusions, and requested limit; a certificate is evidence to investigate, not a promise that a future claim will) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (be paid. Record which employee reviewed each artifact and when it expires. Before dispatch, compare the pickup) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (driver's identity and equipment against the carrier's validated instructions and the facility's release process. Never email) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (an unrestricted pickup reference to an unverified replacement dispatcher. The tracking owner then watches pickup) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (confirmation, appointment changes, and delivery proof, escalating missed events through a documented call tree. At) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (delivery, collect legible proof, count exceptions, temperature records where relevant, and signed accessorial) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (authorization. A clean packet should reach billing on the delivery day in this model. Measure the hours from delivery to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (accepted invoice, because every avoidable billing delay extends the cash bridge even when the shipper technically pays) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (within their agreed terms.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (Separate three incidents that often become one vague accounting dispute. Identity fraud means the accepted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (counterparty or payment beneficiary may be false; a cargo claim means the goods suffered an alleged loss; a billing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (dispute means the contracted amount or documentation is contested. For suspected double brokering, freeze) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (unconfirmed release or remittance instructions, preserve messages and identity evidence, and contact the shipper and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (verified carrier through independent channels. For cargo damage, preserve delivery exceptions and insurer notification) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (evidence while applying the actual contracts and claim procedures. 49 U.S.C. ? 14706 addresses carrier liability for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (covered transportation; it does not make every broker a carrier or settle contractual allocation automatically. For) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (disputed accessorials, segregate the challenged component and pursue the supported invoice amount. Do not erase the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (original invoice or create a second shipment to make collections look cleaner. Route corrections through an authorized) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (reversal and replacement journal in the deployed ledger. One $2,500 absorbed claim consumes 1.25 standard $2,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (load contributions before overhead. That sensitivity belongs in the risk review, not as an unrecorded deduction hidden) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (inside the canonical Base figures.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (Close every day with three queues: shipments missing evidence, invoices awaiting acceptance, and bank movements) Tj ET
